E22A                             ; carry clear, and then the address is pushed back.
E22A   38           H_RET:    SEC      
E22B                RET1:        
E22B   68                     PLA      
E22C   68                     PLA      ; drop the step frame
E22D   68                     PLA      
E22E   85 00                  STA   IP   
