E3F8   E6 01        SQW:      INC   IP+1   ; Y went round: on into the next page
E3FA   D0 DF                  BNE   sq2   ; always
E3FC   20 4B E4     SQQ:      JSR   sqip   ; a string: step over it
E3FF   20 7E E0               JSR   skipstr   
